# .env.production carried production DB credentials + JWT_SECRET when it
# was tracked (ISSUE-018). Ignoring it stops future re-tracking. The
# secrets already committed to history still need rotation and history
# scrub — that is a manual coordination step, not something the ignore
# rule fixes on its own. Local physical copies (Louise, Sylvain, servers)
# stay untouched by the untrack.
.env.production
